---
Data Model Summary
Fact Tables
Appointment Fact: Granularity = one row per appointment (date, provider, patient, service, revenue, cost)
Clinical Outcome Fact: Treatment-level detail (procedure codes, success indicators, follow-up flags)
Dimension Tables
Patient Dim: Patient ID, demographics, registration date, active status (Type 2)
Provider Dim: Provider ID, credentials, specialty, location assignment (Type 2)
Service Dim: Service code, description, category, base fee
Location Dim: Clinic ID, address, region, capacity
Time Dim: Date, fiscal period, day-of-week, holiday flags
Reference Dim: Lookup values (appointment status, outcome codes, payment methods)
